# CyberGuard SOC Lab — Environment Configuration Example
#
# CyberGuard SOC Lab runs entirely client-side using synthetic telemetry
# and browser localStorage. No external API keys or credentials are required.
#
# Optional development server configuration:
# Set to "true" to disable Vite HMR and file watching (e.g., in CI or headless runs).
# DISABLE_HMR="false"
